<BaseLayout title="Applications | Flowin pipes & fittings" description="Explore Flowin ranges by application: plumbing, drainage and agriculture. Find product families and catalogue references."><SiteHeader /><main id="main-content" tabindex="-1"><section class="wrap simple-hero"><p class="kicker">Browse by application</p><h1>Start with the job.<br />Find the range.</h1><p>Explore the catalogue systems relevant to your requirement. Check the final material, size and joint specification for your installation.</p></section><section class="wrap application-grid" aria-label="Application paths"><article class="application-panel"><figure><img src="/images/plumbing-sergei-starostin.jpg" alt="Plumber working on a pipe connection" width="900" height="600" /></figure><div><p class="kicker">Plumbing</p><h2>For the next run and connection.</h2><p>Find pipes and fitting families across the separate uPVC and cPVC catalogue ranges. Compare the printed schedules, SDR groups and sizes.</p><div class="application-links"><a href="/products/upvc/">uPVC plumbing</a><a href="/products/cpvc/">cPVC plumbing</a></div></div></article><article class="application-panel"><figure><img src="/images/plumber-installation-generated.png" alt="AI-generated plumber and plastic pipe application scene" width="1536" height="1024" loading="lazy" /></figure><div><p class="kicker">Drainage</p><h2>Keep the joint system clear.</h2><p>SWR ring-fit and self-fit are separate catalogue sections. Browse each system's pipes and fitting families before preparing your list.</p><div class="application-links"><a href="/products/swr/">SWR range</a><a href="/products/swr/ring-fit-pipes/">Ring-fit pipes</a><a href="/products/swr/self-fit-pipes/">Self-fit pipes</a></div></div></article><article class="application-panel"><figure><img src="/images/irrigation-daniel-kawed.jpg" alt="Workers fixing irrigation piping in a banana plantation" width="900" height="600" loading="lazy" /></figure><div><p class="kicker">Agriculture</p><h2>Compare the pipe groups.</h2><p>Browse the printed lengths and pressure or class groups in the agriculture range, then find the fitting families for your requirement.</p><div class="application-links"><a href="/products/agriculture/">Agriculture range</a><a href="/products/agriculture/pipes/">Pipe tables</a></div></div></article></section><section class="catalogue-banner"><div class="wrap"><div><h2>Application first. Specification next.</h2><p>Use these paths to browse. Confirm suitability for your installation against the required specification before selecting a product.</p></div><a class="solid-btn" href="/catalogue/">Open the catalogue</a></div></section></main><SiteFooter /></BaseLayout>
